### Store-level grep SQL + per-row re.search — `SqliteStore.grep` (lines 87-99)

File: `/Users/vibes/Documents/Development/Projects/muck/src/muck/stores/sqlite_store.py`

```python
87  def grep(self, conn, pattern, k, filters=None):
88      where, params = _filter_sql(filters)
89      sql = (
90          "SELECT c.chunk_id AS chunk_id, c.text AS text FROM chunks c "
91          "JOIN documents d ON d.doc_id = c.doc_id "
92          "WHERE regexp(?, c.text)" + where + " LIMIT ?"
